{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catickle is a cozy clicker game where you tap a cat and collect adorable skins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to earn random cat skins and build your collection. The more you click, the more surprises await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cats. Lots of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A full inventory system to manage your skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random skin drops while playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capsule opening system with animated reveals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique skins with different rarities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A growing collection to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Daily rewards and bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievements and secrets to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chill music and satisfying sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Community-driven skin suggestions via Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to relax, collect, or just click, Catickle has something for every cat lover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883550?t=1753967711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883550/156cc3edf88328940c777ee53c501e509065880e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753967711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883550/526d571925e8b50bfad015c406f9690f83b37285/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753967711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883550/526d571925e8b50bfad015c406f9690f83b37285/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753967711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descript